abstract: >-
  Browser-based explorer for generalized Collatz dynamics. Release
  v1.0-eoc-realizers adds eoc-realizers.html and js/eocRealizers.js: a
  comparison of least realizers of valuation words for the accelerated 3x+1
  map (periodic convergent words, Sturmian words, extremal actual orbits),
  endpoint-depth selection-effect controls, a near-record control matched on
  orbit length and seed size, a carry-sum residue tower (an empirical Fourier
  diagnostic), and a separated-returns decomposition of corridor occupation
  (EOC Open Problem F).
keywords:
  - Collatz conjecture
  - 3x+1 map
  - valuation words
  - Sturmian words
  - visualization
